              <chunks count="1">
                <chunk name="Container">
                  <items count="4">
                    <item name="Description" type_name="gh_string" type_code="10">Morph a present-day EPW into future-climate EPWs with the Future Weather Generator (future-weather-generator.adai.pt), then feed the result to any Eddy3D workflow. Needs Java 17+ and the generator's .jar, which Eddy3D does not ship: download the distribution you need (CMIP6 Global, CORDEX-CMIP5 Europe, …) into ~/Eddy3D/FWG. The tool is licensed CC BY-NC-SA 4.0 — noncommercial use, attribution required.

Version 1.8.0.827

Version 1.8.0.827

Version 1.9.0.827

Version 1.9.0.827

Version 1.15.0.827

Version 1.15.0.827</item>
